In this study, the model was optimized using adaptive moment estimation with a weight decay rate of 0.1 (AdamW) with a batch size of 128 and an initial learning rate of 0.0001. The learning rate was adjusted using the Noam Learning rate scheduler, with a minimum learning rate set to \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
